    </div>
    <ol class="timeline">
      <li><time>February 2018</time><h3>Forum founded</h3><p>Launched with an open invitation to academics, researchers, interest groups and individuals.</p></li>
      <li><time>2018</time><h3>State actor sensitising workshop, Colombo</h3><p>Introduced the SSF Guidelines to officers from fisheries, environment and coast conservation agencies.</p></li>
      <li><time>2018 to 2019</time><h3>Regional consultations</h3><p>Discussions with fishing communities and state actors in Jaffna, Negombo, Rekawa and Trincomalee.</p></li>
      <li><time>June 2022</time><h3>Interactive platform on fuel-efficient fishing</h3><p>Responded to the fuel crisis with government, industry and fisher leaders.</p></li>
      <li><time>September 2022</time><h3>Fishing for Life 2022</h3><p>First South and South-East Asian Conference on Small Scale Fisheries and Aquaculture.</p></li>
      <li><time>2024</time><h3>Savings for Future</h3><p>Financial inclusion and climate resilience for women fish processors.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
